## Autenticação de Usuário

### Registro de Usuário
POST {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FirstName": "Lucas",
    "LastName": "Pedro",
    "Email": "lucas3@gmail.com",
    "Phone": "11976589382",
    "Password": "Lucas123@",
    "Role": "User"
}

### Login de Usuário
POST {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "lucaspedrofernandes@gmail.com",
    "Password": "Admin123@"
}

## CRUD de usuários (Requer Token JWT)

### Obter todos os usuário
GET {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Users
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}

### Obter um usuário
GET {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}

### Atualizar um usuário
PATCH {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FirstName": "Lucas",
    "LastName": "PedroX",
    "Email": "lucaspedro@gmail.com",
    "Phone": "11976589386"
}

### Excluir um usuário
DELETE {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}

## CRUD de Itens do Cardápio (Requer Token JWT)
### Obter todos os itens do cardápio
GET {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}

### Obter um item do cardápio
GET {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/menu/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}

### Criar um item do cardápio
POST {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary123

------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Pizza de Calabresa
------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Deliciosa pizza com calabresa, queijo e molho especial.
------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

29
------Boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="pepperoni.png"
Content-Type: image/png

<{{image}}
------Boundary123--

### Atualizar um item do cardápio
PATCH {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/menu/1
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pizza de Calabresa Grande",
    "description": "Deliciosa pizza grande com calabresa, queijo e molho especial.",
    "price": 39.90
}

### Excluir um item do cardápio
DELETE {{RestaurantAPI_HostAddress}}/api/menu/10
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_Token}}
